WEBVTT

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:06.020
Hey, Ren-chon? Ren-chon!

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.020
Oh, there you are.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.710
Need something?

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.830
Not really. I was just thinking of 
planting some veggies in the garden.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.400
Want to help me out?

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.420
What?! I can grow vegetables?!

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.910
Wow, you're into this.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.860
I'll call everyone else!

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.890
Sorry to have you all 
come over on a Sunday.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:32.340
I was thinking of planting 
these seedlings in the garden.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.020
You're planting these?

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.040
That's right.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.160
There sure are a lot.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.630
What are they?

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:40.780
Those ones are bell peppers.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:41.430
Bel—

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.470
Actually, I have stuff to do.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:51.940
Gonna do my homework.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.940
I'm just kidding. They're tomatoes.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:56.330
Hey! Why did you lie?!

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:57.840
Lying's really, really bad!

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:01.560
Sorry, sorry. I just felt 
like teasing you a little.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.050
You really hate bell peppers, huh?

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:05.660
Well, they are bitter.

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.330
I'm not a big fan of them, either.

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:08.850
Are you, Hotaru?

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:10.790
I don't mind bell peppers.

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:13.160
You're so grown-up, Hotarun.

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:14.580
For real.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:15.640
Yep.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:19.610
I... I am?

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:44.040
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:55.070
<b>Episode 2</b>

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:55.070
<b>Hotaru Was Really Mature?</b>

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:58.930
Can we start planting them now?

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:00.430
Not just yet.

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:02.490
We need to fertilize them 
and put down the mulch first.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:06.200
<b>Mulch</b>

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.970
Oh, we're starting with that?

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.200
Mulch?

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:08.250
What's this for?

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.670
You lay it down on the ground 
where the seedlings go.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.520
I guess you can think of it 
as a futon for the tomatoes.

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:16.210
A futon?

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.180
I'll put it down just right!

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.620
Okay, then, let's get started.

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:23.590
I placed some stakes so 
we'll know where to plant.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.900
Could you start digging 
some ruts along those?

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.130
Got it.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:38.150
Careful, Renge. You'll throw dirt 
all over us if you dig like that.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.890
Oh, no! I forgot myself!

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:42.070
Understood!

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:43.870
Sheesh...

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.200
Earthworm!

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:59.550
Hey! Why'd you throw dirt 
all over me, Nee-chan?!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.360
I-I didn't mean to!

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.510
An earthworm! There was an earthworm!

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.690
They're planted in such perfect lines.

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:48.260
I'm exhausted...

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.260
All you did was play around.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.970
Hotaru worked harder than anyone.

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:54.720
It kind of got me interested.

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:56.850
We're all done!

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:00.130
Great job, everyone. Now we can...

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.580
It's raining.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.230
It just started out of nowhere.

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:14.370
At least we finished the planting first.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.790
Yeah.

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.150
It's raining really hard now.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.820
Will the tomatoes be okay?

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:25.760
They're plants. I think they 
can handle a little rain.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:26.920
Really?

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:31.170
But they must be cold. 
Can't we do anything for them?

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:33.110
I'm not sure what...

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:35.570
Here, I brought towels.

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:37.430
Thank you.

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:39.830
Ren-chan, let's go inside for now.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:41.550
We should dry ourselves off.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.410
Is something wrong?

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:48.310
Well, Ren-chon was just saying 
the tomatoes looked cold.

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:50.320
They must be cold with just the futon.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:53.110
But if you want more than that, 
you'd have to build them a house.

00:05:53.480 --> 00:05:56.330
Hmm... A house, huh?

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.280
Wait, is this heading toward...

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:06.010
Okay, once the rain stops, 
how about we build a greenhouse?

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.360
It cleared up so quickly.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:15.190
Guess it was a passing shower.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:18.390
Man, I really shouldn't have said that...

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:19.810
I'll help, too!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.890
Okay, you can bring over the vinyl.

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:23.800
Got it!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:52.550
Kazu-nee, look! It's really a house!

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:55.120
You all really worked hard.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:58.240
I never knew this was how 
greenhouses were made.

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:00.650
C-Can we go inside the 
house for a little bit?

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.820
I wanna welcome the tomatoes 
to their new home!

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.510
Sure, go ahead.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.560
Can I come in, too?

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.580
Come on in!

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.320
Koma-chan and Nattsun, too! Come over here!

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:24.160
Look at all the happy tomatoes!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:35.800
<b><b>Non Non Biyori</b></b>

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:47.310
Mom, Mom! Where are the new 
clothes I got the other day?

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:48.640
In your room.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:57.420
I get to see Senpai again today!

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.730
Okay, ready to wrap up for today?

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:11.600
Sure.

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:16.040
Thank you for helping me practice 
even though it's Sunday.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:18.680
You've gotten better since 
last time, haven't you?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:21.570
Well, I've been practicing at home, too...

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.690
Really? That's awesome!

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:27.450
A lot of kids don't bother to practice 
at home. You're working hard!

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.140
N-No, it was really only a little bit...

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:34.580
I'm so proud to have an underclassman 
who learns so quickly.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:37.030
I have nothing more to teach you.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.620
Th-That's being too kind!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.160
Okay, I've decided.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:44.610
I'll push to get you a solo 
at our next concert.

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:45.550
Huh?!

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:47.520
W-Wait a minute!

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:49.690
What? Where'd that come from?

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.500
That's what I want to know!

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:55.140
Th-There's no way I can do a solo!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:01.240
I-I mean, sure, 
I'd like to try it out once...

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:05.520
But I'd get stage fright in front of 
all those people. It'll never work.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:14.680
Oh, but if it's a concert where 
no one else is there...

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.460
Uh, that sounds kinda scary...

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:20.020
Also, I know you're anxious around 
strangers, but are you shy, too?

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:23.980
Um... I get anxious around strangers 
because I'm shy, I guess...

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:25.310
Hmm...

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:30.120
Hey, why don't I introduce you 
to another neighbor of mine?

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.620
Huh? A neighbor this time?

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.760
Yeah! That'll give you some confidence.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:38.790
Our ultimate goal will be to make 
sure you don't get stage fright!

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:41.260
Uh... w-well...

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:47.480
A-All right!

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.990
I'll do my best to overcome 
my anxiety with strangers!

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:52.220
Hey, that's the spirit!

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:53.280
Okay, then, let's go!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.390
Okay!

00:09:54.280 --> 00:10:00.070
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:05.320
So this is my underclassman 
in band, Akane-chan.

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.510
Be nice to her, okay?

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:09.390
Go on, Akane-chan, say hello.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.100
H...

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:22.680
Hello...

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:27.740
Um... a-are you okay?

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:29.120
You're dripping with sweat.

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:30.770
This isn't going so well...

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.410
She gets a little anxious around strangers.

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:36.440
I brought her over here to help 
her get used to new people.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:37.730
I get it!

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:39.310
Akane-chan, was it?

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:42.100
I'm Koshigaya Natsumi. Nice to meet ya!

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:44.900
Hey! Don't be so casual with 
someone older than you!

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:46.840
N-N-No, it's okay!

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.680
Being casual will make it 
easier for me to talk, too!

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.510
Really?

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.660
Okay, I'll take you up on that.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:54.730
I'm Komari. Nice to meet you.

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:57.970
Y-Yeah, I'm pleased to meet you both.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:01.730
Oh, nice to meet you. 
My name's Ichijou Hotaru.

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:04.340
Ichijou-san! It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:06.350
<i>Huh? Only I get the polite treatment?!</i>

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:15.940
Oh, so you both play the flute?

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.620
Y-Yeah, but I'm not that good at it yet...

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.690
I thought I heard some kind of 
music playing this morning.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:22.980
Are you taking a break now?

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:24.400
Yep, that's right.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.970
Perfect timing, then!

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.490
We were about to make some cookies.

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:31.420
You can help us out, then have 
some as a snack on your break.

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:34.040
Oh, that sounds great!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.390
Let's do it, Akane-chan!

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:36.630
O-Okay.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.590
Nissei
Sunflower
Pastry Flour 
For tempura, pastries, okonomiyaki, and udon

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:41.590
Flour, eggs, and butter...

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:43.720
We've got all the utensils and stuff, too.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:46.270
Okay! Everything's ready!

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:48.390
So... what do we do now, exactly?

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.050
Didn't take you long to hit a roadblock...

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:53.950
Um, I think you mix the butter first.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:55.310
Oh, really?

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.510
And it's a good idea to sift the flour

00:11:57.510 --> 00:12:00.890
and set aside some butter to grease 
the cooking sheet, right?

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:02.430
Th-That's right!

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:03.940
You're very good at this, Ichijou-san!

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:06.920
W-Well, I'll go ahead and mix the butter!

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.180
O-Okay...

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:11.720
There's something I've been wondering...

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:15.180
Do you think Hotaru-chan is older than you?

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:16.800
She's in elementary school.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.720
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:21.470
I won't fall for a silly joke like that.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.340
You do think that.

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:30.190
What?! Is that true?!

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:31.980
I'm in fifth grade, actually...

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:32.900
What?!

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:35.710
I-I'm sorry! I guess I 
jumped to conclusions!

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:37.930
No, it's okay, really!

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:40.560
Also, I'm younger than you, 
so you don't have to be so polite.

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:45.610
Oh, um... I'd love to, but since I started 
out polite, it's hard to break the habit...

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:51.690
But according to Renge-chan, a surprise 
can help loosen your nerves,

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:54.210
so maybe a scary story would 
help you speak more casually?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.440
Th-There's no way that would work!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:58.690
I'll get back to mixing the butter now.

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:02.480
Oh, right. Do you have sugar? 
It needs to be mixed in, too.

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:04.790
Oh, isn't there any up there?

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.590
Oh, shoot! It's empty!

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.640
You don't have refills under 
the sink or anything?

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.590
Um... just a sec...

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:15.550
That's salt... Where was the sugar again?

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.560
<b>Caster Sugar</b>

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.560
Thank you.

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:22.230
Komari-chan, there's sugar right here.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.600
Huh? I just looked there 
and didn't see any.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:28.600
Well, someone just left some here...

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:31.160
Huh? No one's there!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.370
It wasn't you, Konomi-senpai?

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.130
No, I was looking around the sink.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:36.870
Huh?

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:40.540
You don't think... A ghost?

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.910
Let's bake the cookies in the living room!

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:46.680
Yeah!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.740
Baking around water is dangerous! 
It's just too dangerous!

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:50.640
Yeah!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:53.070
What are those two doing?

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:56.860
Well... it's nice that they're 
learning to cooperate, I guess?

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:02.670
I feel like all we did in the end was 
have them make cookies for us...

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:06.720
But Hotaru-chan really seems 
very mature, doesn't she?

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:10.260
I hope it doesn't bother her that 
I thought she was older...

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.570
I'm sure she's fine.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:13.810
What about you? Do you feel okay?

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:16.760
I might have been a little forceful 
in taking you to meet them...

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:19.050
Oh, no, I'm totally fine.

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:23.090
I get anxious around strangers, 
but I kind of like being in a group.

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.990
Really? I'm glad to hear that!

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:29.080
Well, Komari-chan, Nacchan, 
and Glasses-kun are all really nice.

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:32.450
Let's keep getting you used to this stuff, 
so you'll be ready for the concert.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.460
O-Okay! I'll do my best!

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:37.510
Wait, hang on... Glasses-kun?

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.360
Was there someone with glasses there?

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:42.120
No, I didn't see him today.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:47.570
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:51.820
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:55.550
Shopping was so much fun!

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:58.960
It's too bad the car broke down and 
we had to take the train home.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.350
Are you worn out now?

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:03.760
No, I'm fine. I haven't 
ridden a train in ages.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:07.560
Hey, Papa, can we eat these 
sweets when we get home?

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:10.280
You just had ice cream at 
the department store.

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:13.050
You shouldn't. You'll spoil 
your appetite for dinner.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.210
What?!

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:17.190
No! No! I can have some, can't I?!

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:18.720
Now, come on, Hotaru...

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:22.820
Please, Papa? Can't I?

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:25.870
Oh, all right. But you'd better 
eat your dinner, too.

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:29.030
Really?! Yay! I love you, Papa!

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.790
Mama, Papa! We're at the station!

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:35.990
Yes, I know.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.990
Come on, let's hurry!

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:43.130
Come on, Hotaru, calm down.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:45.000
Oh, it's fine!

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.660
K-Konomi-san...

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:00.140
Hi there, Hotaru-chan.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.220
Oh? Hotaru, is this a friend?

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:05.040
Hello, it's nice to meet you. 
I'm Fujimiya Konomi.

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.670
I'm a friend of your daughter's.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:08.830
I thought no one else was on that train.

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:11.140
Were we too noisy? Sorry about that.

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:12.790
Oh, no, not at all.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:17.040
I just... didn't have anything 
to do, so I went to town...

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.170
I-I see...

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:21.500
Hotaru, want to visit with 
her before heading home?

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.100
Huh?!

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:24.880
Um... er...

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:33.200
Okay, Hotaru, make sure 
you're home by dinner.

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:33.790
Okay...

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:34.570
Bye.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.320
Uh... sorry about... this.

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:44.160
No, it's okay! I didn't 
have anything else to do!

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.200
Oh...

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:49.860
So, um... are you always like that?

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:55.290
N-N-No, I'm not at all! 
I mean, I am, but... I mean...

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:59.170
I-I didn't think there was anyone 
else on the train, so... um...

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:03.120
Th-That's why I was like 
that with my parents...

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:07.440
Oh, I guess I'd forgotten that 
you're still in fifth grade.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:10.330
It makes sense that you'd be 
like that with your parents.

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:12.520
Y-You think so?

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:14.580
Yeah, that's right...

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:17.130
You're still at an age where 
you want to be babied a bit.

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:20.500
Okay! You can be babyish with me, too!

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.490
Huh?!

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:25.570
Komari-chan was a total baby 
when she was your age, too.

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:26.710
O-Oh...

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:30.650
So I should treat you like an elementary 
schooler, too, shouldn't I?

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:35.920
So there you go! Just jump right 
into my arms, like a child!

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.610
Huh?! U-Um, Konomi-san?

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.680
What's wrong, Hotaru-chan?

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:44.380
I appreciate the sentiment, 
but it's a little too embarrassing...

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:45.700
You're not putting on a front?

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.710
N-No, I'm not! I'm not!

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:50.980
Well, no reason to just 
stand out here talking.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:52.960
Let's hold hands on the way to my house.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:54.750
That's not embarrassing, is it?

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:56.830
U-Um...

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:59.990
You'll get lost if you don't hold my hand.

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:03.760
Have you ever gotten lost before?

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:05.180
A-A few times...

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:06.360
I thought so!

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:09.470
Komari-chan got lost about once a 
month when she was in fifth grade.

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:10.940
What?! Once a month?!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:14.150
So come on. Give me your hand.

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:25.080
Yeah, it was just like this.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.360
Reminds me of when Komari-chan and 
the rest were in elementary school.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.920
R-Really?

00:18:30.350 --> 00:18:35.580
B-By the way, what was Komari-senpai 
like in elementary school?

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.580
Hmm, well...

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:39.650
Not too different from now, really.

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:42.680
She cried a lot, and she's 
not even that much taller.

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:43.810
Wow...

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:46.270
She drank from a bottle until...

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:47.070
A bottle?!

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:50.110
Oh, yeah. Until she was five.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:51.090
Five?!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:53.610
Even that seems a bit late...

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:57.540
Well, that's how Komari-chan was, 
so you don't need to be embarrassed.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:59.800
Kids should act like kids.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:00.660
Right...

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.510
Or would you have preferred to be carried?

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:07.950
Th-That's all right! 
This is perfectly fine!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.920
Well, there's my house.

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:16.470
You didn't get lost. Good job, Hotaru-chan.

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:17.250
Yeah...

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:18.600
Huh?

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:22.010
Why're you two holding hands?

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.880
K-K-K-Komari-senpai!

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.090
Th-This isn't what you think! It's...

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:28.760
Well, some things happened, and...

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.800
You know, since Hotaru-chan's 
in fifth grade,

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:33.540
I thought I should treat her 
like an elementary schooler.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:34.540
Y-Yeah!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.480
Oh, I get it.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:39.340
That's right. You are still 
in elementary school, huh?

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:41.250
Hey, I've got a great idea!

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:42.390
Come over here!

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:44.240
There.

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:47.300
Come on, Hotaru, over here.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:50.580
I'll lend you my lap for 
a pillow, as a big sister!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.220
Y-Your lap?!

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:54.900
Oh, yeah, I did that for you a lot.

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:57.080
You might as well let her indulge you, too.

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:57.800
Huh?!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:00.180
Come on, Hotaru. Right over here.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.600
<i>Senpai's lap... as a pillow...</i>

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:09.500
Hotaru, what's the problem?

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:13.910
Hotaru?

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:18.920
U-U-Using your lap as a pillow 
is just too embarrassing!

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:23.080
I-I-I'm going home for today!

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:25.690
She left...

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:29.570
Maybe we went too far. 
We'll have to apologize later.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:36.580
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:53.970
Yesterday was so embarrassing.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:57.980
I can't let the others see me act like 
that around my parents anymore.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:08.320
Hey, Pechi, you'll get a 
tummyache if you eat grass.

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:09.830
Come over here.

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:16.150
Jeez, Pechi, that tickles.

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:20.320
Oh, it's you, Hotaru-chan.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:24.550
Sorry about yesterday. 
You can just act the way you always—

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.940
Oh, Pechi, you're so cute!

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:29.130
I'm gonna give you cuddles!

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:32.710
Here! Cuddle, cuddle! Cuddle, cuddle!

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.550
Cuddle, cuddle, cuddle! Cuddle, cuddle!

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:38.430
Cuddle, cuddle, cuddle! Cuddle, 
cuddle, cuddle, cuddle, cuddle!

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:40.300
Cuddle, cuddle, cuddle, cuddle!

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:43.490
Cuddle! Cuddle, cuddle, cuddle, 
cuddle, cuddle, cuddle!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:46.470
I'll cuddle you even more when we get home!

00:21:55.570 --> 00:21:56.320
Uh...

00:21:58.480 --> 00:21:59.250
Uh...

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:04.460
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:13.140
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:32.430
Let's play, Natsumi!

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:35.300
I'm not sure if we can get clay 
from our yard, though...

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:36.790
What's the matter?

00:23:36.790 --> 00:23:38.480
How about this, then?!

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:40.860
Hikage-chan, why are you dressed like that?

00:23:40.860 --> 00:23:44.530
Finisher: Surefire Kill!

00:23:44.530 --> 00:23:46.600
A komuso just popped out of the bushes!

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:50.610
<b>Next Time
Episode 3</b>

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:50.610
<b>We Were Always Like This</b>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:54.110
Photo: Genbor-No

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:54.110
